  "prefLabel": "Puc 2102.03 Competitive affiliate",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2102.03 “Competitive affiliate” means any affiliate of a utility that is engaged in the sale or marketing of products or services on a competitive basis and includes any competitive energy affiliate.\n\nSource. #7884-A, eff 5-2-03, EXPIRED: 5-2-11\n\nNew. #9921, eff 5-3-11; ss by #10909, eff 8-8-15; ss by #14556, eff 4-15-26, EXPIRES: 4-15-36",
